  "summary_html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\">\n\n\n\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Quenton Delancy</b> is the <a href=\"/wiki/Ghosts\" title=\"Ghosts\">ghost</a> of a fisherman who has long haunted the city of <a href=\"/wiki/Skara_Brae\" title=\"Skara Brae\">Skara Brae</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Avatar\" title=\"Avatar\">Avatar</a> was able to meet him both in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ultima_VI:_The_False_Prophet\" title=\"Ultima VI: The False Prophet\">Ultima&#160;VI</a></i> and in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ultima_VII:_The_Black_Gate\" title=\"Ultima VII: The Black Gate\">Ultima&#160;VII</a></i>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">",
